From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KNX IoT Demos <noreply@knx.org>
Date: Fri, 27 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drivers: ieee802154: esp32: Implement get_sch_acc

Implement the get_sch_acc radio API callback, which returns the crystal
oscillator accuracy in PPM. The Zephyr OpenThread platform calls this
via otPlatRadioGetCslAccuracy() -> otPlatTimeGetXtalAccuracy() when
CONFIG_OPENTHREAD_TIME_SYNC is enabled. Without this implementation
the function pointer is NULL, causing a fatal crash the first time
OpenThread tries to upgrade the device to router role (Address Solicit).

The accuracy value is configurable via
CONFIG_IEEE802154_ESP32_XTAL_ACCURACY_PPM (default: 20 ppm, matching
the ESP32-C6 40 MHz crystal datasheet specification).

Signed-off-by: KNX IoT Demos <noreply@knx.org>
---
 drivers/ieee802154/Kconfig.esp32        | 9 +
 drivers/ieee802154/ieee802154_esp32.c   | 8 +
 2 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

--- a/drivers/ieee802154/ieee802154_esp32.c
+++ b/drivers/ieee802154/ieee802154_esp32.c
@@ -629,6 +629,13 @@
 	ieee802154_init(iface);
 }
 
+static uint8_t esp32_get_sch_acc(const struct device *dev)
+{
+	ARG_UNUSED(dev);
+
+	return CONFIG_IEEE802154_ESP32_XTAL_ACCURACY_PPM;
+}
+
 static const struct ieee802154_radio_api esp32_radio_api = {
 	.iface_api.init = esp32_iface_init,
 
@@ -643,6 +650,7 @@
 	.ed_scan          = esp32_ed_scan,
 	.configure        = esp32_configure,
 	.attr_get         = esp32_attr_get,
+	.get_sch_acc      = esp32_get_sch_acc,
 };
 
 #if defined(CONFIG_NET_L2_IEEE802154)
--- a/drivers/ieee802154/Kconfig.esp32
+++ b/drivers/ieee802154/Kconfig.esp32
@@ -182,4 +182,13 @@
 
 	  This config is used in the Espressif HAL module.
 
+
+config IEEE802154_ESP32_XTAL_ACCURACY_PPM
+	int "Crystal oscillator accuracy in PPM"
+	default 20
+	range 1 255
+	help
+	  Accuracy of the crystal oscillator in parts per million (PPM).
+	  Used by OpenThread for CSL scheduling and time synchronization.
+	  The ESP32-C6 uses a 40 MHz crystal with +/-20 ppm typical accuracy.
 endif # IEEE802154_ESP32
--
2.47.0
